#. ID 48, Page 2, Line 3, Pos (25,16)
#. ID 49, Page 2, Line 3, Pos (34,16)
msgid "何かが嵌まりそうな窪みがある。"
msgstr "有一个似乎能嵌进什么东西的凹槽。"

#. ID 48, Page 2, Line 8, Pos (25,16)
#. Contains choice at line 2 (2 options)
#. ID 49, Page 2, Line 8, Pos (34,16)
#. Contains choice at line 2 (2 options)
msgid "蒼い宝玉を嵌めてみますか。"
msgstr "要试着嵌入苍蓝宝玉吗？"

#. ID 48, Page 2, Line 9, Pos (25,16)
#. Choice (2 options, embedded in a message)
#. ID 49, Page 2, Line 9, Pos (34,16)
#. Choice (2 options, embedded in a message)
